    "detailed_description": "Sate (Satay) is the most popular food in Indonesia and some countries in Asia. In this game you will build a business from scratch to become successful!<br><br>Improve your business facilities, advertise your business, meet various kinds of customers day or night and do the available daily missions.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Manage and develop your satay business<br></li><li>Upgrade your facilities<br></li><li>Lots of characters<br></li><li>Advertise your business<br></li><li>Daily missions<br></li><li>Meet the VIP!<br></li><li>Collect some airdrops<br></li><li>Day and night cycle</li></ul><br>And most importantly, collect the money and make your satay business the best in the world!",
